.vscode/**
.gitignore
*.vsix
**/*.map

# Unlike the grammar-only 0.1.0 release, this extension now has a runtime
# dependency (vscode-languageclient) that must ship inside the .vsix, so
# node_modules is intentionally NOT excluded here. Run `npm install
# --omit=dev` (or just `npm install`, since there are no devDependencies)
# before `vsce package` so only the production dependency tree is present.
